drawDB 1.8.2 — reference distribution
=====================================

What is distributed here
------------------------
drawdb-1.8.2-dist.tar.gz is the static build of drawDB 1.8.2 exactly as the
release image ghcr.io/drawdb-io/drawdb:v1.8.2 ships it: the image layer that
holds /usr/share/nginx/html (sha256 d75037aa1890aa74545341ba64396f618c1fab42641109d31843986c16e618a1).
drawDB's own release workflow (.github/workflows/docker.yml) builds that image
from the tag v1.8.2 (annotated "Release v1.8.2").

drawdb-1.8.2-source.tar.gz is the GitHub archive of the tag v1.8.2
(https://github.com/drawdb-io/drawdb/archive/refs/tags/v1.8.2.tar.gz,
sha256 044ddeba7d1a777c0d088397c9c5c63af13a88723de91748ae979bd06d6da3f2):
the complete corresponding source of the build, with package-lock.json
pinning every dependency the build bundles.
Homepage and source repository: https://github.com/drawdb-io/drawdb

server.py and start.sh are task-authored: they serve the files of the image
layer unchanged, answer /config.js as the release image does when no backend
is configured, and answer index.html for every other path (as the image's
nginx configuration does). No product file is modified.

