Packages the page loads from public CDNs
----------------------------------------
index.html of the build loads Bootstrap Icons 1.11.1 and Font Awesome Free
6.5.2 from public CDNs, and the code editor loads Monaco Editor 0.52.2 from
a CDN. These packages are not part of this directory: the task's base image
holds their npm releases (with their own license files) and the black-box
runtime answers the CDN addresses from that copy. Bootstrap Icons: MIT.
Font Awesome Free: icons CC BY 4.0, fonts SIL OFL 1.1, code MIT. Monaco
Editor: MIT (with its ThirdPartyNotices.txt).

